      "value": "Hi, a little bit confused on this:\nI'm pretty sure there is no way for you to generate any of those words in an invite. On top of that, there's no way for you to specify the instance ID when dropping a portal, aside from dropping a portal to an instance you find in the world browser.\nThis might be a bug, but I'm very interested in how you managed to encounter it, and how you would expect a normal user to replicate?",
