      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: i dont use mods but i can expect modders can edit existing portals or delete them and specify the instance id in a foreverportal too as ive observed stuff like this before. \nthis could be used as an attack on streamers (invites, official or userportals) if they really didnt use streamer mode.\nyou guys make the api, you should know how to use it :p\nand no with vrc alone you prob cant make them, maybe with the website though.\ni used vrcx actually theres some fancy front gui where you can make instance invites. while this may not be used as an regular attack, its a completely reproducable (temporarily) gamebreaking (ofc very low priority) bug that has to do with the api.\ni think the random censoring here is funny, the clients behaviour in this case amuses me, idk where else this filter may be on haha\nedit: https://vrchat.net/launch?worldId=wrld_ccbf8103-c23e-472f-8efb-38a9a9164357&instanceId=penis also works",
