  "details": "giving u a black screen, need to restart vrc, rest in black.\nvrc will fix itself after like 2 minutes and instead create and join you a new friendsonly instance with a random id.\ncould be abused in invites and portals by maliscious players.\n\nreproduce:\nhttps://vrchat.net/launch?worldId=wrld_853c9929-53a4-4138-95fa-cfe9edefccc5&instanceId=penis\n\nworked with $hit, penis and f§ck. bingo, sex, ass, vrchat, foo and asdf as instance ids worked fine.\ni dont have the list of what vrc counts as cusswords so i cant test them all sadly.\n\none output of the log:\n\n-----\n2021.04.17 02:04:56 Log        -  [Behaviour] Entering world\n2021.04.17 02:04:57 Error      -  [API] [154, 400, Get, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/instances/wrld_f39c8ee2-f774-4548-9162-3412147ab38f:penis/join\nNo Exception\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"'pants' is not a valid instanceId\",\"status_code\":400}}}}\n-----\n\nthe behaviour similar to an invalid id like \"Dont_Join_This_Instance_LOL\" or \"-1\"\n\nlel\n\nidk but i just found this funny, please fix tupper and the other dev bois",
